리에 새로운 제약을 추가하는 프레임워크입니다","es":"validation-add-constraint es una característica para agregar nuevas restricciones a la biblioteca de validación","fr":"validation-add-constraint est une fonctionnalité pour ajouter de nouvelles contraintes à la bibliothèque de validation","de":"validation-add-constraint ist eine Funktion zum Hinzufügen neuer Einschränkungen zur Validierungsbibliothek","pt":"Adicionar restrições de validação em Golang é o processo de criar regras para verificar a validade dos dados","ru":"Добавление ограничений валидации в Golang - это процесс создания правил для проверки достоверности данных для ИИ Агентов","ar":"إضافة قيود التحقق من الصحة في Golang هي عملية إنشاء قواعد للتحقق من صحة البيانات"},"features":{"en":["Adds new constraints to the validation library via the `it` function","Requires message constants and translations for English and Russian languages","Supports optional `validate` and `is` functions for standalone validation","Mandatory steps include adding message constants, translations, tests, and examples","Utilizes godoc for documentation and code readability"],"zh":["基于静态类型和泛型的验证框架","添加新的约束到验证库中","支持消息常量和翻译","包含测试和示例","支持 godoc 文档"],"ja":["静的型付けとジェネリクスに基づくバリデーションフレームワーク","バリデーションライブラリに新しい制約を追加","メッセージ定数と翻訳のサポート","テストとサンプルの含まれる","godoc ドキュメントのサポート - AIエージェント"],"ko":["정적 타이핑과 제네릭스 기반의 유효성 검사 프레임워크","유효성 검사 라이브러리에 새로운 제약을 추가","메시지 상수와 번역 지원","테스트와 예제 포함","godoc 문서 지원"],"es":["Soporte para tipado estático y genéricos en Golang","Capacidad para agregar nuevas restricciones a la biblioteca de validación","Generación de mensajes de error personalizados","Compatibilidad con traducciones en inglés y ruso","Pruebas y ejemplos para garantizar la calidad"],"fr":["Prise en charge du typage statique et des génériques en Golang","Capacité à ajouter de nouvelles contraintes à la bibliothèque de validation","Génération de messages d''erreur personnalisés","Compatibilité avec les traductions en anglais et en russe","Tests et exemples pour garantir la qualité"],"de":["Unterstützung für statisches Typing und Generics in Golang","Fähigkeit, neue Einschränkungen zur Validierungsbibliothek hinzuzufügen","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Fehlermeldungen","Kompatibilität mit Übersetzungen in Englisch und Russisch","Tests und Beispiele für die Qualitätssicherung"],"pt":["Criação de mensagens de erro personalizadas","Adição de traduções para vários idiomas","Utilização de generics e tipagem estática para validação","Criação de testes e exemplos para validação","Integração com a biblioteca de validação do Golang"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских сообщений об ошибках","Добавление переводов для нескольких языков для ИИ Агентов","Использование generics и статической типизации для валидации","Создание тестов и примеров для валидации","Интеграция с библиотекой валидации Golang"],"ar":["إنشاء رسائل خطأ مخصصة","إضافة ترجمات للغات متعددة","استخدام الجينيريكس والتحقق من الصحة الثابتة","إنشاء اختبارات وأمثلة للتحقق من الصحة","التكامل مع مكتبة التحقق من الصحة في Golang"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use validation-add-constraint","validation-add-constraint setup guide","Golang validation framework","adding custom constraints to validation library","validation-add-constraint vs other validation frameworks","validation-add-constraint install for Golang"],"zh":["Golang 验证框架","validation-add-constraint","静态类型","泛型","验证库","AI工具","Golang 开发"],"ja":["Golang バリデーションフレームワーク","validation-add-constraint","静的型付け","ジェネリクス","バリデーションライブラリ","AIエージェント","Golang 開発"],"ko":["Golang 유효성 검사 프레임워크","validation-add-constraint","정적 타이핑","제네릭스","유효성 검사 라이브러리","AI 도구","Golang 개발"],"es":["validation-add-constraint","Golang","tipado estático","genéricos","biblioteca de validación","agentes de IA","herramientas de validación"],"fr":["validation-add-constraint","Golang","typage statique","génériques","bibliothèque de validation","outils d''IA","outils de validation"],"de":["validation-add-constraint","Golang","statisches Typing","Generics","Validierungsbibliothek","KI-Tools","Validierungstools"],"pt":["validação em Golang","restrições de validação","mensagens de erro personalizadas","traduções para vários idiomas","generics e tipagem estática","testes e exemplos para validação","biblioteca de validação do Golang"],"ru":["валидация в Golang","ограничения валидации для ИИ Агентов","пользовательские сообщения об ошибках","переводы для нескольких языков","generics и статическая типизация","тесты и примеры для валидации","библиотека валидации Golang"],"ar":["التحقق من الصحة في Golang","قيود التحقق من الصحة","رسائل خطأ مخصصة","ترجمات للغات متعددة","الجينيريكس والتحقق من الصحة الثابتة","اختبارات وأمثلة للتحقق من الصحة","مكتبة التحقق من الصحة في Golang"]}},"owner":"muonsoft","repo":"validation","repoPath":"muonsoft/validation","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.471Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"validation-add-constraint","description":"Adds new validation constraints to the Go validation library. Use when adding a new constraint to package it, translations (message, english, russian), optional validate/is helpers, tests in test/, and examples in it/example_test.go or validate/example_test.go.","bodyPreview":"# Adding a New Constraint to the Validation Library\n\nFollow this workflow when adding a new constraint. Mandatory steps: constraint in `it`, message constant, translations (english + russian), tests, examples, godoc. Optional: `validate` and `is` when useful for standalone validation (e.g. string codes, identifiers).\n\n---\n\n## 1. Message and Error (mandatory)\n\n### 1.1 Add message constant\n\nIn **`message/messages.go`** add a new constant (English default text):\n\n```go\nconst (\n\t// ... existing\n\tInv","body":"# Adding a New Constraint to the Validation Library\n\nFollow this workflow when adding a new constraint. Mandatory steps: constraint in `it`, message constant, translations (english + russian), tests, examples, godoc. Optional: `validate` and `is` when useful for standalone validation (e.g. string codes, identifiers).\n\n---\n\n## 1. Message and Error (mandatory)\n\n### 1.1 Add message constant\n\nIn **`message/messages.go`** add a new constant (English default text):\n\n```go\nconst (\n\t// ... existing\n\tInvalidMyFormat = \"This value is not a valid my format.\"\n)\n```\n\n- Use existing style: `InvalidXxx`, `NotXxx`, `TooXxx`, etc.\n- Text is the default (English) template; placeholders like `{{ value }}`, `{{ limit }}` are allowed.\n\n### 1.2 Add validation error\n\nIn **`errors.go`** (root package) add:\n\n```go\nvar (\n\t// ... existing\n\tErrInvalidMyFormat = NewError(\"invalid my format\", message.InvalidMyFormat)\n)\n```\n\n- First argument: stable **code** (backward compatibility).\n- Second argument: **message constant** from `message` package (used for translation key and default text).\n\n---\n\n## 2. Translations (mandatory)\n\nAdd the **same key** (the message constant) in both translation files.\n\n### 2.1 English\n\nIn **`message/translations/english/messages.go`**:\n\n```go\nvar Messages = map[language.Tag]map[string]catalog.Message{\n\tlanguage.English: {\n\t\t// ... existing\n\t\tmessage.InvalidMyFormat: catalog.String(message.InvalidMyFormat),\n\t},\n}\n```\n\n- For simple messages use `catalog.String(message.Const)` or `catalog.String(\"Your English text.\")`.\n- For plurals (e.g. \"N elements\") use `plural.Selectf(1, \"\", plural.One, \"...\", plural.Other, \"...\")`. See [reference.md](reference.md) for plural and Russian forms.\n\n### 2.2 Russian\n\nIn **`message/translations/russian/messages.go`**:\n\n```go\nvar Messages = map[language.Tag]map[string]catalog.Message{\n\tlanguage.Russian: {\n\t\t// ... existing\n\t\tmessage.InvalidMyFormat: catalog.String(\"Значение не является допустимым форматом.\"),\n\t},\n}\n```\n\n- Key is always the **message constant** from `message` package.\n- Value: Russian text; same placeholders as in the message constant (e.g. `{{ value }}`).\n- For plurals use `plural.Selectf(1, \"\", plural.One, \"...\", plural.Few, \"...\", plural.Other, \"...\")` — Russian has Few. See [reference.md](reference.md).\n\n---\n\n## 3. Constraint in package `it` (mandatory)\n\nChoose the right file: `it/string.go`, `it/identifiers.go`, `it/web.go`, `it/comparison.go`, `it/basic.go`, `it/iterable.go`, `it/date_time.go`, `it/choice.go`, `it/barcodes.go`.\n\n### 3.1 Simple string constraint (func(string) bool)\n\nIf the check is a pure `func(string) bool`, use `OfStringBy` and the `is` helper:\n\n```go\n// IsMyFormat validates whether the value is in my format.\n// See [link] for specification.\nfunc IsMyFormat() validation.StringFuncConstraint {\n\treturn validation.OfStringBy(is.MyFormat).\n\t\tWithError(validation.ErrInvalidMyFormat).\n\t\tWithMessage(validation.ErrInvalidMyFormat.Message())\n}\n```\n\n### 3.2 Custom struct constraint\n\nWhen you need options (e.g. versions, formats), define a struct and implement `ValidateString`:\n\n```go\n// MyConstraint validates whether the string value satisfies my format.\n// Use [MyConstraint.Option] to configure.\ntype MyConstraint struct {\n\tisIgnored       bool\n\tgroups          []string\n\toptions         []func(o *validate.MyOptions)\n\terr             error\n\tmessageTemplate string\n\tmessageParameters validation.TemplateParameterList\n}\n\n// IsMy creates the constraint.\nfunc IsMy() MyConstraint {\n\treturn MyConstraint{\n\t\terr:             validation.ErrInvalidMyFormat,\n\t\tmessageTemplate: validation.ErrInvalidMyFormat.Message(),\n\t}\n}\n\n// WithError overrides default error for produced violation.\nfunc (c MyConstraint) WithError(err error) MyConstraint { ... }\n\n// WithMessage sets the violation message template.\nfunc (c MyConstraint) WithMessage(template string, parameters ...validation.TemplateParameter) MyConstraint { ... }\n\n// When / WhenGroups for conditional validation.\nfunc (c MyConstraint) When(condition bool) MyConstraint { ... }\nfunc (c MyConstraint) WhenGroups(groups ...string) MyConstraint { ... }\n\nfunc (c MyConstraint) ValidateString(ctx context.Context, validator *validation.Validator, value *string) error {\n\tif c.isIgnored || validator.IsIgnoredForGroups(c.groups...) || value == nil || *value == \"\" {\n\t\treturn nil\n\t}\n\tif is.My(*value, c.options...) {\n\t\treturn nil\n\t}\n\treturn validator.BuildViolation(ctx, c.err, c.messageTemplate).\n\t\tWithParameters(\n\t\t\tc.messageParameters.Prepend(\n\t\t\t\tvalidation.TemplateParameter{Key: \"{{ value }}\", Value: *value},\n\t\t\t)...,\n\t\t).\n\t\tCreate()\n}\n```\n\nTemplate rules:\n\n- **Empty/nil**: Usually skip (return `nil`); use `it.IsNotBlank()` (or similar) to reject empty.\n- **Violation**: Use `validator.BuildViolation(ctx, c.err, c.messageTemplate).WithParameters(...).Create()`. Do not use `CreateViolation` for translatable constraints — use `BuildViolation` so the message is translated.\n- **Godoc**: Document the constraint type and constructor; document options; add `See ...` for specs if applicable.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Tests (mandatory)\n\nIn **`test/constraints_*_cases_test.go`** (create or extend the right file, e.g. `constraints_identifiers_cases_test.go`):\n\n- Define a slice of `ConstraintValidationTestCase`.\n- Use `name`, `isApplicableFor: specificValueTypes(stringType)` (or other type), `stringValue: stringValue(\"...\")`, `constraint: it.IsMyFormat()`, `assert: assertNoError` or `assertHasOneViolation(validation.ErrInvalidMyFormat, message.InvalidMyFormat)`.\n- Cover: valid, invalid, empty/nil (if applicable), options (e.g. WithError/WithMessage), When(false)/When(true).\n\nAdd the slice to **`validateTestCases`** in **`test/constraints_test.go`** via `mergeTestCases(...)` so the shared test runners pick it up.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Examples (mandatory)\n\nIn **`it/example_test.go`** add testable examples:\n\n```go\nfunc ExampleIsMyFormat_valid() {\n\terr := validator.Validate(context.Background(), validation.String(\"valid-value\", it.IsMyFormat()))\n\tfmt.Println(err)\n\t// Output:\n\t// <nil>\n}\n\nfunc ExampleIsMyFormat_invalid() {\n\terr := validator.Validate(context.Background(), validation.String(\"invalid\", it.IsMyFormat()))\n\tfmt.Println(err)\n\t// Output:\n\t// violation: \"This value is not a valid my format.\"\n}\n```\n\nUse `// Output:` so `go test` runs them. Prefer `ExampleXxx_valid` / `ExampleXxx_invalid` naming.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Optional: package `validate`\n\nAdd when the constraint is useful for **standalone validation** (e.g. string codes, identifiers), without the full validator.\n\n- **File**: `validate/identifiers.go` or new file (e.g. `validate/myformat.go`).\n- **Signature**: `func MyFormat(value string) error` (or with options).\n- **Return**: `nil` if valid; otherwise a sentinel error from `validate` package (e.g. `ErrTooShort`, or custom).\n- **Godoc**: Describe when it returns which error.\n- **Tests**: `validate/*_test.go` table or cases.\n- **Examples**: `validate/example_test.go` with `ExampleMyFormat` and `// Output:`.\n\nIf the `it` constraint needs options, define option types and funcs in `validate` (e.g. `validate.MyOptions`, `validate.AllowXxx()`), and use them from `it` and `is`.\n\n---\n\n## 7. Optional: package `is`\n\nAdd when useful for **standalone boolean checks** (e.g. in conditions, or for `OfStringBy`).\n\n- **File**: `is/identifiers.go` or same area as related `validate` logic.\n- **Signature**: `func MyFormat(value string) bool` or `func MyFormat(value string, options ...func(o *validate.MyOptions)) bool`.\n- **Implementation**: Usually `return validate.MyFormat(value, options...) == nil`.\n- **Godoc**: Short description; point to `validate` for options and semantics.\n- **Tests**: `is/*_test.go`.\n- **Examples**: `is/example_test.go` with `ExampleMyFormat` and `// Output:`.\n\n---\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] `message/messages.go`: new constant\n- [ ] `errors.go`: `ErrXxx = NewError(\"code\", message.Xxx)`\n- [ ] `message/translations/english/messages.go`: key = message const, value = English\n- [ ] `message/translations/russian/messages.go`: key = message const, value = Russian\n- [ ] `it/*.go`: constraint (StringFuncConstraint or custom struct), godoc, empty/nil handling, BuildViolation\n- [ ] `test/constraints_*_cases_test.go`: test cases + merge into `validateTestCases`\n- [ ] `it/example_test.go`: ExampleXxx_valid, ExampleXxx_invalid with `// Output:`\n- [ ] Optional: `validate`: function, tests, examples, godoc\n- [ ] Optional: `is`: function, tests, examples, godoc\n- [ ] `go test ./...` and `golangci-lint run`\n\n---\n\n## Additional resources\n\n- Plural forms and Russian translation details: [reference.md](reference.md)\n- Existing patterns: `it/identifiers.go` (UUID/ULID), `it/string.go` (OfStringBy), `test/constraints_identifiers_cases_test.go`, `message/translations/`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:09:35.122Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Golang Development Agents specializing in building type-safe validation frameworks.","zh":"非常适合专门构建类型安全验证框架的 Golang 开发智能体。","ja":"型安全な検証フレームワークの構築を専門とする Golang 開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"타입 세이프 검증 프레임워크 구축을 전문으로 하는 Golang 개발 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo de Golang que se especializan en la creación de frameworks de validación de tipo seguro.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement Golang spécialisés dans la création de frameworks de validation de type sécurisé.","de":"Ideal für Golang-Entwicklungsagenten, die auf den Bau von typsicheren Validierungsframeworks spezialisiert sind.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Golang especializados em construir frameworks de validação seguros em termos de tipos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки Golang, специализирующихся на создании фреймворков валидации, безопасных для типов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير Golang المتخصص في بناء إطارات التحقق من الصحة آمنة من النوع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to extend validation libraries with custom constraints using Golang generics and static typing. Provides structured error handling with built-in internationalization (i18n) support through message constants and translations.","zh":"使智能体能够使用 Golang 泛型和静态类型，通过自定义约束来扩展验证库。通过消息常量和翻译提供内置国际化 (i18n) 支持的结构化错误处理。","ja":"Golang のジェネリクスと静的型付けを使用して、カスタム制約で検証ライブラリを拡張することをエージェントに可能にします。メッセージ定数と翻訳を通じて、組み込みの国際化 (i18n) サポートを備えた構造化されたエラー処理を提供します。","ko":"Golang 제네릭과 정적 타입을 사용하여 사용자 정의 제약 조건으로 검증 라이브러리를 확장할 수 있도록 에이전트에 기능을 제공합니다. 메시지 상수와 번역을 통해 내장된 국제화(i18n) 지원을 갖춘 구조화된 오류 처리를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes ampliar las bibliotecas de validación con restricciones personalizadas utilizando genéricos de Golang y tipado estático. Proporciona un control de errores estructurado con soporte integrado de internacionalización (i18n) a través de constantes de mensaje y traducciones.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''étendre les bibliothèques de validation avec des contraintes personnalisées en utilisant les génériques Golang et le typage statique. Fournit une gestion d''erreurs structurée avec un support d''internationalisation (i18n) intégré via des constantes de message et des traductions.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Validierungsbibliotheken mit benutzerdefinierten Einschränkungen mithilfe von Golang-Generics und statischem Typing zu erweitern. Bietet strukturierte Fehlerbehandlung mit integrierter Internationalisierungsunterstützung (i18n) über Nachrichtenkonstanten und Übersetzungen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes estendam bibliotecas de validação com restrições personalizadas usando generics do Golang e digitação estática. Fornece tratamento de erros estruturado com suporte à internacionalização (i18n) incorporado por meio de constantes de mensagens e traduções.","ru":"Позволяет агентам расширять библиотеки валидации с помощью пользовательских ограничений, используя generics Golang и статическую типизацию. Предоставляет структурированное xử lý ошибок с встроенной поддержкой интернационализации (i18n) через константы сообщений и переводы.","ar":"يمكن للوكيل扩展 مكتبات التحقق من الصحة باستخدام قيود مخصصة باستخدام جينيريكس Golang والكتابة الثابتة. يوفر معالجة أخطاء منظم مع دعم مدمج للتوحيد (i18n) من خلال ثوابت الرسائل والترجمات."},"useCases":{"en":["Adding custom validation rules to Golang applications","Generating localized error messages for international users","Creating comprehensive test suites for validation constraints"],"zh":["向 Golang 应用程序添加自定义验证规则","为国际用户生成本地化的错误消息","为验证约束创建全面的测试套件"],"ja":["Golang アプリケーションへのカスタム検証ルールの追加","国際ユーザー向けのローカライズされたエラーメッセージの生成","検証制約のための包括的なテストスイートの作成"],"ko":["Golang 애플리케이션에 사용자 정의 검증 규칙 추가","국제 사용자를 위한 지역화된 오류 메시지 생성","검증 제약 조건을 위한 포괄적인 테스트 스위트 생성"],"es":["Agregar reglas de validación personalizadas a aplicaciones de Golang","Generar mensajes de error localizados para usuarios internacionales","Crear suites de prueba exhaustivas para restricciones de validación"],"fr":["Ajouter des règles de validation personnalisées aux applications Golang","Générer des messages d''erreur localisés pour les utilisateurs internationaux","Créer des suites de tests exhaustives pour les contraintes de validation"],"de":["Hinzufügen benutzerdefinierter Validierungsregeln zu Golang-Anwendungen","Generieren lokalisierter Fehlermeldungen für internationale Benutzer","Erstellen umfassender Test-Suiten für Validierungs-Einschränkungen"],"pt":["Adicionar regras de validação personalizadas a aplicativos Golang","Gerar mensagens de erro localizadas para usuários internacionais","Criar conjuntos de testes abrangentes para restrições de validação"],"ru":["Добавление пользовательских правил валидации в приложения Golang","Генерация локализованных сообщений об ошибках для международных пользователей","Создание всесторонних наборов тестов для ограничений валидации"],"ar":["إضافة قواعد التحقق من الصحة المخصصة إلى تطبيقات Golang","توليد رسائل خطأ محلية للمستخدمين الدوليين","إنشاء مجموعات اختبار شاملة للقيود التحقق من الصحة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Golang environment with generics support","Mandatory implementation of translations for all supported languages","Needs complete test coverage for each constraint"],"zh":["需要支持泛型的 Golang 环境","必须为所有支持的语言实现翻译","每个约束都需要完整的测试覆盖"],"ja":["ジェネリクスをサポートする Golang 環境が必要","サポートされる全ての言語に対する翻訳の実装が必須","各制約に対して完全なテストカバレッジが必要"],"ko":["제네릭을 지원하는 Golang 환경 필요","지원되는 모든 언어에 대한 번역 구현 필수","각 제약 조건에 대한 완전한 테스트 커버리지 필요"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de Golang con soporte para genéricos","Implementación obligatoria de traducciones para todos los idiomas admitidos","Necesita una cobertura de pruebas completa para cada restricción"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Golang avec un support pour les génériques","Mise en œuvre obligatoire des traductions pour toutes les langues prises en charge","Nécessite une couverture de tests complète pour chaque contrainte"],"de":["Benötigt eine Golang-Umgebung mit Generics-Unterstützung","Pflichtumsetzung von Übersetzungen für alle unterstützten Sprachen","Benötigt eine vollständige Testabdeckung für jede Einschränkung"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Golang com suporte a generics","Implementação obrigatória de traduções para todos os idiomas suportados","Necessita de cobertura de teste completa para cada restrição"],"ru":["Требуется среда Golang с поддержкой generics","Обязательная реализация переводов для всех поддерживаемых языков","Требуется полное покрытие тестированием для каждого ограничения"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Golang مع دعم جينيريكس","تنفيذ إلزامي للترجمات لجميع اللغات المدعومة","يحتاج إلى تغطية اختبار كاملة لكل قيد"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"0cd2af8c955332ff0f819f7d4207f3c9d8f9fae672be216679f6beccfa8dc2f9","qualityScore":33}');
