 아키텍처는 소프트웨어 시스템의 구조와 조직 형태를 말합니다","es":"La arquitectura de software es el diseño y la estructura de un sistema de software, basada en principios de Clean Architecture y Domain Driven Design","fr":"L''architecture logicielle est la conception et la structure d''un système logiciel, basée sur les principes de Clean Architecture et de Domain Driven Design","de":"Die Software-Architektur ist die Gestaltung und Struktur eines Software-Systems, basierend auf Clean-Architecture- und Domain-Driven-Design-Prinzipien","pt":"Arquitetura de software é a prática de projetar e desenvolver sistemas de software com foco em qualidade e escalabilidade","ru":"Архитектура программного обеспечения - это практика проектирования и разработки систем программного обеспечения с фокусом на качестве и масштабируемости для ИИ Агентов","ar":"هندسة البرمجيات هي ممارسة تصميم وتطوير أنظمة البرمجيات بتركيز على الجودة والتماسك"},"features":{"en":["Applies early return pattern for better code readability","Avoids code duplication through reusable functions and modules","Decomposes long components into smaller, manageable pieces","Follows Clean Architecture principles for separated concerns","Implements Domain Driven Design for domain-centric development","Promotes modular code organization for easier maintenance"],"zh":["遵循Clean Architecture原则","采用Domain Driven Design模式","使用早期返回模式提高代码可读性","避免代码重复","分解长代码组件"],"ja":["Clean Architectureの原則に従う","Domain Driven Designパターンを採用","早期リターン パターンを使用してコードの可読性を向上させる","コードの重複を避ける","長いコードコンポーネントを分解する"],"ko":["Clean Architecture 원칙을 따름","Domain Driven Design 패턴을 사용","초기 반환 패턴을 사용하여 코드의 가독성을 향상","코드 중복을 피함","긴 코드 컴포넌트를 분해"],"es":["Patrón de retorno temprano para una mejor legibilidad del código","Evitación de la duplicación de código a través de la creación de funciones y módulos reutilizables","Descomposición de componentes largos en elementos más pequeños y manejables","Aplicación de principios de Clean Architecture y Domain Driven Design","Mejora de la mantenibilidad y escalabilidad del código"],"fr":["Modèle de retour précoce pour une meilleure lisibilité du code","Évitement de la duplication de code grâce à la création de fonctions et de modules réutilisables","Décomposition de composants longs en éléments plus petits et gérables","Application des principes de Clean Architecture et de Domain Driven Design","Amélioration de la maintenabilité et de l''évolutivité du code"],"de":["Frühzeitiges Rückgabemuster für eine bessere Lesbarkeit des Codes","Vermeidung von Code-Duplizierung durch die Erstellung von wiederverwendbaren Funktionen und Modulen","Zerlegung langer Komponenten in kleinere und handhabbare Elemente","Anwendung von Clean-Architecture- und Domain-Driven-Design-Prinzipien","Verbesserung der Wartbarkeit und Skalierbarkeit des Codes"],"pt":["Padrão de retorno antecipado para melhor legibilidade","Evitar duplicação de código com funções e módulos reutilizáveis","Decomposição de componentes longos para melhor manutenção","Aplicação de princípios de Clean Architecture","Integração com Domain Driven Design"],"ru":["Паттерн раннего возврата для лучшей читаемости","Избежание дублирования кода с помощью повторно используемых функций и модулей","Разделение длинных компонентов для лучшего обслуживания","Применение принципов Clean Architecture","Интеграция с Domain Driven Design для ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["نمط الإعادة المبكرة لتحسين القراءة","تجنب تكرار الكود باستخدام دوال ووحدات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","تقسيم المكونات الطويلة لتحسين الصيانة","تطبيق مبادئ التصميم النظيف","التكامل مع التصميم الموجه للنطاق"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use software-architecture","software-architecture best practices","clean architecture principles","domain driven design tutorial","software-architecture setup guide","software-architecture vs monolithic architecture","implementing early return pattern","reusable functions in software development","software-architecture install"],"zh":["软件架构开发","Clean Architecture","Domain Driven Design","代码可读性","代码重复","软件系统设计","AIエージェント","软件开发最佳实践"],"ja":["ソフトウェアアーキテクチャ開発","Clean Architecture","Domain Driven Design","コードの可読性","コードの重複","ソフトウェアシステム設計","AIエージェント","ソフトウェア開発ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["소프트웨어 아키텍처 개발","Clean Architecture","Domain Driven Design","코드 가독성","코드 중복","소프트웨어 시스템 설계","AI 에이전트","소프트웨어 개발 가이드"],"es":["arquitectura de software","Clean Architecture","Domain Driven Design","desarrollo de software","patrón de retorno temprano","evitación de duplicación de código","descomposición de componentes","mejora de la mantenibilidad","escalabilidad del código"],"fr":["architecture logicielle","Clean Architecture","Domain Driven Design","développement de logiciels","modèle de retour précoce","évitement de la duplication de code","décomposition de composants","amélioration de la maintenabilité","évolutivité du code"],"de":["Software-Architektur","Clean Architecture","Domain-Driven-Design","Software-Entwicklung","Frühzeitiges Rückgabemuster","Vermeidung von Code-Duplizierung","Zerlegung von Komponenten","Verbesserung der Wartbarkeit","Skalierbarkeit des Codes"],"pt":["arquitetura de software","desenvolvimento de software","Clean Architecture","Domain Driven Design","padrões de código","desenvolvimento de sistemas","qualidade de software","escalabilidade de software"],"ru":["архитектура программного обеспечения","разработка программного обеспечения","Clean Architecture","Domain Driven Design","паттерны кода","разработка систем","качество программного обеспечения","масштабируемость программного обеспечения","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["هندسة البرمجيات","برمجة البرمجيات","التصميم النظيف","التصميم الموجه للنطاق","أنماط الكود","تطوير الأنظمة","جودة البرمجيات","التماسك البرمجي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"v24kuon","repo":"django-booking","repoPath":"v24kuon/django-booking","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.486Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"software-architecture","description":"Guide for quality focused software architecture. This skill should be used when users want to write code, design architecture, analyze code, in any case that relates to software development.","bodyPreview":"# Software Architecture Development Skill\n\nThis skill provides guidance for quality focused software development and architecture. It is based on Clean Architecture and Domain Driven Design principles.\n\n## Code Style Rules\n\n### General Principles\n\n- **Early return pattern**: Always use early returns when possible, over nested conditions for better readability\n- Avoid code duplication through creation of reusable functions and modules\n- Decompose long (more than 80 lines of code) components and f","body":"# Software Architecture Development Skill\n\nThis skill provides guidance for quality focused software development and architecture. It is based on Clean Architecture and Domain Driven Design principles.\n\n## Code Style Rules\n\n### General Principles\n\n- **Early return pattern**: Always use early returns when possible, over nested conditions for better readability\n- Avoid code duplication through creation of reusable functions and modules\n- Decompose long (more than 80 lines of code) components and functions into multiple smaller components and functions. If they cannot be used anywhere else, keep it in the same file. But if file longer than 200 lines of code, it should be split into multiple files.\n- Follow the language-idiomatic style for functions/classes and the project''s formatter/linter (do not enforce JS/TS-specific patterns in non-JS codebases)\n\n### Best Practices\n\n#### Library-First Approach\n\n- **ALWAYS search for existing solutions before writing custom code**\n  - Check your ecosystem’s package registry for existing libraries (e.g., npm/PyPI/crates.io/Maven Central/NuGet/Packagist/RubyGems)\n  - Evaluate existing services/SaaS solutions\n  - Consider third-party APIs for common functionality\n- Use libraries instead of writing your own utils or helpers when it reduces risk and maintenance (e.g., a well-maintained retry/backoff library instead of hand-rolled retry logic).\n- **When custom code IS justified:**\n  - Specific business logic unique to the domain\n  - Performance-critical paths with special requirements\n  - When external dependencies would be overkill\n  - Security-sensitive code requiring full control\n  - When existing solutions don''t meet requirements after thorough evaluation\n\n#### Architecture and Design\n\n- **Clean Architecture & DDD Principles:**\n  - Follow domain-driven design and ubiquitous language\n  - Separate domain entities from infrastructure concerns\n  - Keep business logic independent of frameworks\n  - Define use cases clearly and keep them isolated\n- **Naming Conventions:**\n  - **AVOID** generic names: `utils`, `helpers`, `common`, `shared`\n  - **USE** domain-specific names: `OrderCalculator`, `UserAuthenticator`, `InvoiceGenerator`\n  - Follow bounded context naming patterns\n  - Each module should have a single, clear purpose\n- **Separation of Concerns:**\n  - Do NOT mix business logic with UI components\n  - Keep database queries out of controllers\n  - Maintain clear boundaries between contexts\n  - Ensure proper separation of responsibilities\n\n#### Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n- **NIH (Not Invented Here) Syndrome:**\n  - Don''t build custom auth/session management when a trusted, supported solution exists and fits requirements\n  - Don''t invent a bespoke state/validation framework if the ecosystem has mature, well-supported options\n- **Poor Architectural Choices:**\n  - Mixing business logic with UI components\n  - Database queries directly in controllers\n  - Lack of clear separation of concerns\n- **Generic Naming Anti-Patterns:**\n  - `utils.js` with 50 unrelated functions\n  - `helpers/misc.js` as a dumping ground\n  - `common/shared.js` with unclear purpose\n- Remember: Every line of custom code is a liability that needs maintenance, testing, and documentation\n\n#### Code Quality\n\n- Proper error handling with typed catch blocks\n- Break down complex logic into smaller, reusable functions\n- Avoid deep nesting (max 3 levels)\n- Keep functions focused and under 50 lines when possible\n- Keep files focused and under 200 lines of code when possible\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:10:04.091Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing advanced software architecture guidance and clean code principles.","zh":"非常适合需要高级软件架构指导和清洁代码原则的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードレビューエージェントが高度なソフトウェアアーキテクチャの指針とクリーンコードの原則を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"코드 리뷰 에이전트가 고급 소프트웨어 아키텍처 가이드와 깨끗한 코드 원칙을 필요로 할 때 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan orientación avanzada sobre arquitectura de software y principios de código limpio.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant une orientation avancée sur l''architecture logicielle et les principes de code propre.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agenten, die eine fortgeschrittene Anleitung zur Softwarearchitektur und sauberen Code-Prinzipien benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de orientação avançada em arquitetura de software e princípios de código limpo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов код-ревью, которым необходима продвинутая поддержка в области программной архитектуры и чистых принципов кода.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراجعة الكود الذين يحتاجون إلى إرشادات متقدمة في هندسة البرمجيات ومبادئ الكود النظيف."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce Clean Architecture and Domain Driven Design principles, ensuring better code readability through early return patterns and avoiding code duplication with reusable functions and modules.","zh":"赋予代理强制执行清洁架构和领域驱动设计原则，通过早期返回模式和可重用函数及模块避免代码重复，确保更好的代码可读性。","ja":"クリーンアーキテクチャとドメイン駆動設計の原則を適用して、コードの可読性を向上させ、早期リターン パターンを使用してコードの重複を避け、再利用可能な関数とモジュールを使用してコードの可読性を向上させます。","ko":"클린 아키텍처와 도메인 주도 설계 원칙을 적용하여 코드 가독성을 향상시키고, 조기 반환 패턴을 사용하여 코드 중복을 피하고, 재사용 가능한 함수 및 모듈을 사용하여 코드 가독성을 향상시킵니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar principios de Arquitectura Limpia y Diseño Orientado al Dominio, garantizando una mejor legibilidad del código a través de patrones de retorno anticipado y evitando la duplicación de código con funciones y módulos reutilizables.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer les principes d''Architecture Propre et de Conception Orientée vers le Domaine, garantissant une meilleure lisibilité du code grâce à des modèles de retour anticipé et en évitant la duplication de code avec des fonctions et des modules réutilisables.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Clean Architecture- und Domain-Driven-Design-Prinzipien durchzusetzen, um durch frühe Rückgabemuster und das Vermeiden von Code-Duplizierung mit wiederverwendbaren Funktionen und Modulen eine bessere Code-Lesbarkeit zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor princípios de Arquitetura Limpa e Domain Driven Design, garantindo uma melhor legibilidade de código por meio de padrões de retorno antecipado e evitando duplicação de código com funções e módulos reutilizáveis.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать соблюдение принципов Чистой Архитектуры и Domain Driven Design, обеспечивая лучшую читаемость кода посредством ранних шаблонов возврата и избегая дублирования кода с помощью многократно используемых функций и модулей.","ar":"يمكّن الوكيل من فرض مبادئ الهندسة المعمارية النظيفة وتصميم الدومين الموجه، مما يضمن أفضل قراءة للكود من خلال نمط العودة المبكر وتجنب تكرار الكود مع الوظائف والوحدات القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام."},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing code style rules for maintainable codebases","Decomposing long components into smaller, manageable modules","Applying Domain Driven Design principles for robust software development"],"zh":["执行代码样式规则以实现可维护的代码库","将长组件分解为较小、可管理的模块","应用领域驱动设计原则以实现强大的软件开发"],"ja":["メンテナブルなコードベースのためのコードスタイル規則の適用","長いコンポーネントを小さく管理可能なモジュールに分解する","堅牢なソフトウェア開発のためのドメイン駆動設計の原則の適用"],"ko":["유지 보수 가능한 코드베이스를 위한 코드 스타일 규칙 적용","긴 컴포넌트를 작은 관리 가능한 모듈로 분해","강력한 소프트웨어 개발을 위한 도메인 주도 설계 원칙 적용"],"es":["Aplicar reglas de estilo de código para bases de código mantenibles","Descomponer componentes largos en módulos más pequeños y manejables","Aplicar principios de Diseño Orientado al Dominio para un desarrollo de software robusto"],"fr":["Appliquer des règles de style de code pour des bases de code maintainables","Décomposer de longs composants en modules plus petits et gérables","Appliquer les principes de Conception Orientée vers le Domaine pour un développement de logiciels robuste"],"de":["Regeln für Code-Stile für wartbare Codebasen anwenden","Lange Komponenten in kleinere, handhabbare Module zerlegen","Prinzipien des Domain-Driven-Designs für robuste Softwareentwicklung anwenden"],"pt":["Impor regras de estilo de código para bases de código mantidas","Decompor componentes longos em módulos menores e gerenciáveis","Aplicar princípios de Domain Driven Design para desenvolvimento de software robusto"],"ru":["Внедрение правил стилей кода для поддерживаемых баз кода","Разделение длинных компонентов на более мелкие, управляемые модули","Применение принципов Domain Driven Design для создания прочного программного обеспечения"],"ar":["فرض قواعد نمط الكود للمصادر القابلة للصيانة","تقسيم المكونات الطويلة إلى وحدات صغيرة وقابلة للإدارة","تطبيق مبادئ تصميم الدومين الموجه لتنمية برنامج قوي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of software development principles","Focused on Clean Architecture and Domain Driven Design","May require adjustments for projects with existing architecture"],"zh":["需要了解软件开发原则","专注于清洁架构和领域驱动设计","可能需要针对具有现有架构的项目进行调整"],"ja":["ソフトウェア開発の原則の理解が必要","クリーンアーキテクチャとドメイン駆動設計に焦点を当てている","既存のアーキテクチャを持つプロジェクトの場合、調整が必要になる可能性がある"],"ko":["소프트웨어 개발 원칙에 대한 이해가 필요","클린 아키텍처와 도메인 주도 설계에 중점을 두고 있음","既存의 아키텍처를 가진 프로젝트의 경우 조정이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de principios de desarrollo de software","Se centra en Arquitectura Limpia y Diseño Orientado al Dominio","Puede requerir ajustes para proyectos con arquitectura existente"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des principes de développement de logiciels","Se concentre sur l''Architecture Propre et la Conception Orientée vers le Domaine","Peut nécessiter des ajustements pour les projets avec une architecture existante"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis für Software-Entwicklungsprinzipien","Konzentriert sich auf Clean Architecture und Domain-Driven-Design","Kann Anpassungen für Projekte mit bestehender Architektur erfordern"],"pt":["Exige compreensão dos princípios de desenvolvimento de software","Focado em Arquitetura Limpa e Domain Driven Design","Pode exigir ajustes para projetos com arquitetura existente"],"ru":["Требует понимания принципов разработки программного обеспечения","Фокусируется на Чистой Архитектуре и Domain Driven Design","Может требовать корректировки для проектов с существующей архитектурой"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مبادئ تطوير البرمجيات","مركز على الهندسة المعمارية النظيفة وتصميم الدومين الموجه","قد يتطلب التعديلات للمشاريع ذات الهندسة المعمارية الحالية"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"c3628caa844f02d12218ec711073dd9dbcb8154283c8e3fb5b652430ce332c2d","qualityScore":33}');
