INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('AI-Robot-SW/pedestrian-companion-robot/background-testing', 'background-testing', 'AI-Robot-SW', 'pedestrian-companion-robot', 'community', 'background-testing AI-Robot-SW pedestrian-companion-robot community The background-testing skill provides rules and patterns for writing pytest tests for Backgrounds in OM Cortex Runtime, ensuring consistent testing and hardware independence. 背景测试是OM Cortex Runtime中的一个重要组成部分，需要遵循特定的规则和结构 Background TestingはOM Cortex Runtimeの重要なコンポーネントであり、特定のルールと構造に従う必要があります 백그라운드 테스팅은 OM Cortex Runtime의 중요한 구성 요소이며 특정 규칙과 구조를 따라야 합니다 Guía técnica para pruebas de fondo en AI Agent con pytest y OM Cortex Runtime Guide technique pour les tests d''arrière-plan avec les outils d''IA et pytest Technische Anleitung für Hintergrundtests in KI-Agents mit pytest Este guia fornece regras e padrões para escrever testes pytest para Backgrounds em OM Cortex Runtime, garantindo testes consistentes e sem hardware Этот гид предоставляет правила и шаблоны для написания тестов pytest для Фонов в OM Cortex Runtime, гарантируя последовательные тесты и отсутствие аппаратного обеспечения يوفر هذا الدليل قواعد وأنماط لكتابة اختبارات pytest للخلفيات في برنامج OM Cortex Runtime، مما يضمن اختبارات متسقة وبدون أجهزة how to use background-testing background-testing setup guide pytest testing for Backgrounds OM Cortex Runtime testing background-testing vs unittest background-testing install for AI Agents 背景测试 OM Cortex Runtime pytest Background测试 Provider模拟 测试一致性 AI工具 AIエージェント Initializes and starts Providers in `__init__` Runs pytest tests without hardware dependency Ensures consistent testing for Backgrounds in OM Cortex Runtime Follows implementation rules for test assumptions Constructs Providers in `__init__` for reliable testing background-testing is a set of guidelines for writing pytest tests for Backgrounds in OM Cortex Runtime, focusing on consistency and hardware independence.');
