rkanwendungen","pt":"Padrões de Unity Netcode são estruturas de código para desenvolver jogos multiplayer com autoridade distribuída","ru":"Шаблоны Unity Netcode - это кодовые структуры для разработки многопользовательских игр с распределенной властью","ar":"نماذج يونيتي نيتكود هي هياكل كودية لتطوير ألعاب متعددة اللاعبين مع السلطة الموزعة"},"features":{"en":["Configures NetworkManager for Distributed Authority topology","Sets up player prefab spawning for networked games","Manages scene transitions for seamless network experience","Implements NetworkBehaviour basics, including OnNetworkSpawn and OnNetworkDespawn","Initializes grid management on session owner using IsServer check","Uses C# scripting for custom NetworkBehaviour implementation"],"zh":["分布式权威设置","NetworkManager 配置","玩家预制体生成","场景管理","NetworkBehaviour 基础"],"ja":["分散型の権限設定","NetworkManager の構成","プレイヤー プレハブの生成","シーン管理","NetworkBehaviour の基礎"],"ko":["분산 권한 설정","네트워크 매니저 구성","플레이어 프리팹 생성","씬 관리","네트워크 동작 기본"],"es":["Configuración de NetworkManager para autoridad distribuida","Gestión de escenas en red con NetworkBehaviour","Uso de OnNetworkSpawn y OnNetworkDespawn para inicializar y limpiar recursos","Configuración de prefabs de jugador para una experiencia en red sin problemas","Implementación de lógica de servidor y cliente con IsServer y NetworkBehaviour"],"fr":["Configuration de NetworkManager pour une autorité distribuée","Gestion de scènes en réseau avec NetworkBehaviour","Utilisation de OnNetworkSpawn et OnNetworkDespawn pour initialiser et nettoyer les ressources","Configuration de prefabs de joueur pour une expérience en réseau sans problème","Mise en œuvre de la logique de serveur et de client avec IsServer et NetworkBehaviour"],"de":["Konfiguration von NetworkManager für eine verteilte Autorität","Verwaltung von Netzwerk-Szenen mit NetworkBehaviour","Verwendung von OnNetworkSpawn und OnNetworkDespawn zum Initialisieren und Bereinigen von Ressourcen","Konfiguration von Spieler-Prefabs für eine reibungslose Netzwerkerfahrung","Implementierung von Server- und Client-Logik mit IsServer und NetworkBehaviour"],"pt":["Configuração de autoridade distribuída","Gerenciamento de cena para redes","Utilização de NetworkBehaviour para inicialização de objetos","Configuração de player prefab spawning","Integração com NetworkManager"],"ru":["Настройка распределенной власти","Управление сценой для сетей","Использование NetworkBehaviour для инициализации объектов","Настройка спавнинга префабов игрока","Интеграция с NetworkManager"],"ar":["تهيئة السلطة الموزعة","إدارة المشهد للشبكات","استخدام NetworkBehaviour لتهيئة الكائنات","تهيئة-spawning-lprefab-lplayer","التكامل مع NetworkManager"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use unity-netcode-patterns","unity-netcode-patterns setup guide","unity-netcode-patterns vs Mirror","unity-netcode-patterns install","what is unity-netcode-patterns","unity-netcode-patterns alternative","unity netcode patterns tutorial","unity netcode patterns example","unity netcode patterns documentation"],"zh":["Unity Netcode Patterns","分布式权威设置","NetworkManager","网络行为","Unity 网络编程","C# 网络编程"],"ja":["Unity Netcode パターン","分散型の権限設定","NetworkManager","ネットワーク動作","Unity ネットワークプログラミング","C# ネットワークプログラミング"],"ko":["유니티 네트워크 코드 패턴","분산 권한 설정","네트워크 매니저","네트워크 동작","유니티 네트워크 프로그래밍","C# 네트워크 프로그래밍"],"es":["patrones de Unity Netcode","autoridad distribuida","gestión de escenas en red","NetworkManager","NetworkBehaviour","OnNetworkSpawn","OnNetworkDespawn","desarrollo de juegos en red","aplicaciones de red"],"fr":["modèles Unity Netcode","autorité distribuée","gestion de scènes en réseau","NetworkManager","NetworkBehaviour","OnNetworkSpawn","OnNetworkDespawn","développement de jeux en réseau","applications réseau"],"de":["Muster von Unity Netcode","verteilte Autorität","Netzwerk-Szenenverwaltung","NetworkManager","NetworkBehaviour","OnNetworkSpawn","OnNetworkDespawn","Entwicklung von Netzwerkspielen","Netzwerkanwendungen"],"pt":["unity netcode","jogos multiplayer","autoridade distribuída","gerenciamento de cena","NetworkBehaviour","NetworkManager","desenvolvimento de jogos","padrões de código","ИИ Агенты"],"ru":["unity netcode","многопользовательские игры","распределенная власть","управление сценой","NetworkBehaviour","NetworkManager","разработка игр","кодовые структуры","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["يونيتي نيتكود","ألعاب متعددة اللاعبين","السلطة الموزعة","إدارة المشهد","NetworkBehaviour","NetworkManager","تطوير الألعاب","هياكل الكود","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"psychicDree","repo":"PirateTileClash","repoPath":"psychicDree/PirateTileClash","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.513Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"unity-netcode-patterns","description":"Common Unity Netcode for GameObjects patterns and solutions for Distributed Authority. Use when implementing network features, debugging sync issues, or working with NetworkBehaviour classes.","bodyPreview":"# Unity Netcode Patterns\n\n## Distributed Authority Setup\n\n### NetworkManager Configuration\n- Use Distributed Authority topology\n- Configure player prefab spawning\n- Set up scene management for network\n\n### NetworkBehaviour Basics\n```csharp\npublic class GridManager : NetworkBehaviour\n{\n    public override void OnNetworkSpawn()\n    {\n        if (IsServer)\n        {\n            // Initialize on Session Owner\n            InitializeGrid();\n        }\n    }\n    \n    public override void OnNetworkDespaw","body":"# Unity Netcode Patterns\n\n## Distributed Authority Setup\n\n### NetworkManager Configuration\n- Use Distributed Authority topology\n- Configure player prefab spawning\n- Set up scene management for network\n\n### NetworkBehaviour Basics\n```csharp\npublic class GridManager : NetworkBehaviour\n{\n    public override void OnNetworkSpawn()\n    {\n        if (IsServer)\n        {\n            // Initialize on Session Owner\n            InitializeGrid();\n        }\n    }\n    \n    public override void OnNetworkDespawn()\n    {\n        // Cleanup\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## NetworkVariable Patterns\n\n### Simple Value Sync\n```csharp\nprivate NetworkVariable<int> health = new NetworkVariable<int>(\n    default,\n    NetworkVariableReadPermission.Everyone,\n    NetworkVariableWritePermission.Server\n);\n\n// Update on server\nif (IsServer)\n{\n    health.Value = newHealth;\n}\n\n// Read on all clients\nvoid Update()\n{\n    if (health.Value != _lastHealth)\n    {\n        UpdateHealthUI(health.Value);\n        _lastHealth = health.Value;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Struct Sync\n```csharp\npublic struct PlayerStats : INetworkSerializable\n{\n    public int Health;\n    public int Mana;\n    \n    public void NetworkSerialize<T>(BufferSerializer<T> serializer) where T : IReaderWriter\n    {\n        serializer.SerializeValue(ref Health);\n        serializer.SerializeValue(ref Mana);\n    }\n}\n\nprivate NetworkVariable<PlayerStats> stats = new NetworkVariable<PlayerStats>();\n```\n\n## NetworkList Patterns\n\n### Collection Sync\n```csharp\nprivate NetworkList<TileData> _tileGrid;\n\npublic override void OnNetworkSpawn()\n{\n    _tileGrid = new NetworkList<TileData>();\n    \n    if (IsServer)\n    {\n        InitializeGrid();\n    }\n    \n    _tileGrid.OnListChanged += HandleTileGridChanged;\n}\n\nprivate void HandleTileGridChanged(NetworkListEvent<TileData> changeEvent)\n{\n    switch (changeEvent.Type)\n    {\n        case NetworkListEvent<TileData>.EventType.Add:\n            // New tile added\n            break;\n        case NetworkListEvent<TileData>.EventType.Remove:\n            // Tile removed\n            break;\n        case NetworkListEvent<TileData>.EventType.Value:\n            // Tile value changed\n            break;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## RPC Patterns\n\n### ServerRpc - Client to Server\n```csharp\n[ServerRpc(RequireOwnership = false)]\npublic void ClaimTileServerRpc(int x, int y, ServerRpcParams rpcParams = default)\n{\n    if (!IsServer) return;\n    \n    ulong clientId = rpcParams.Receive.SenderClientId;\n    \n    // Validate and process\n    if (ValidateTileClaim(x, y, clientId))\n    {\n        ClaimTile(x, y, clientId);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### ClientRpc - Server to Clients\n```csharp\n[ClientRpc]\npublic void TileDestroyedClientRpc(int x, int y)\n{\n    // Execute on all clients\n    SpawnDestructionParticles(x, y);\n    PlayDestructionSound();\n}\n```\n\n### Targeted ClientRpc\n```csharp\n[ClientRpc]\npublic void ShowVictoryClientRpc(ClientRpcParams rpcParams = default)\n{\n    // Only show to specific client\n    UIManager.Instance.ShowVictoryScreen();\n}\n```\n\n## Ownership Patterns\n\n### Client Owns Character\n```csharp\npublic class PlayerController : NetworkBehaviour\n{\n    void Update()\n    {\n        if (!IsOwner) return; // Only owner processes input\n        \n        HandleInput();\n    }\n    \n    [ServerRpc]\n    void MoveServerRpc(Vector3 position)\n    {\n        // Server validates movement\n        transform.position = position;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Server Owns Grid\n```csharp\npublic class GridManager : NetworkBehaviour\n{\n    void Update()\n    {\n        if (!IsServer) return; // Only server modifies grid\n        \n        ProcessGridUpdates();\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Late Join Handling\n\n### Sending State to Late Joiners\n```csharp\npublic override void OnNetworkSpawn()\n{\n    if (IsServer)\n    {\n        // Late joiner - send current state\n        if (NetworkManager.Singleton.ConnectedClients.Count > 1)\n        {\n            SendFullGridStateClientRpc();\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n[ClientRpc]\nvoid SendFullGridStateClientRpc()\n{\n    // Receive full grid state\n    InitializeGridFromState();\n}\n```\n\n## Network Events\n\n### Connection Events\n```csharp\npublic override void OnNetworkSpawn()\n{\n    if (IsServer)\n    {\n        NetworkManager.Singleton.OnClientConnectedCallback += OnClientConnected;\n        NetworkManager.Singleton.OnClientDisconnectCallback += OnClientDisconnected;\n    }\n}\n\nvoid OnClientConnected(ulong clientId)\n{\n    Debug.Log($\"[SessionManager] Client {clientId} connected\");\n    // Send current game state\n}\n\nvoid OnClientDisconnected(ulong clientId)\n{\n    Debug.Log($\"[SessionManager] Client {clientId} disconnected\");\n    // Clean up client-specific data\n}\n```\n\n## Common Solutions\n\n### Synchronized Timers\n```csharp\nprivate NetworkVariable<float> turnTimer = new NetworkVariable<float>();\n\nvoid Update()\n{\n    if (IsServer)\n    {\n        turnTimer.Value -= Time.deltaTime;\n        if (turnTimer.Value <= 0)\n        {\n            EndTurn();\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Authority Validation\n```csharp\n[ServerRpc(RequireOwnership = false)]\npublic void PlayCardServerRpc(int cardId, ServerRpcParams rpcParams = default)\n{\n    if (!IsServer) return;\n    \n    ulong clientId = rpcParams.Receive.SenderClientId;\n    \n    // Validate player can play this card\n    if (!CanPlayerPlayCard(clientId, cardId))\n    {\n        Debug.LogWarning($\"[CardManager] Invalid card play from {clientId}\");\n        return;\n    }\n    \n    // Execute card\n    ExecuteCard(cardId, clientId);\n}\n```\n\n## Performance Tips\n\n### Minimize Network Updates\n- Update NetworkVariables only when values change\n- Batch NetworkList updates when possible\n- Use ClientRpc for one-time events, NetworkVariable for frequent updates\n\n### Optimize Message Size\n- Keep RPC parameters small\n- Use enums instead of strings when possible\n- Compress data structures when needed\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:10:29.997Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Game Development Agents requiring expertise in Unity Netcode for multiplayer applications.","zh":"适用于需要 Unity Netcode 多人游戏应用专业知识的游戏开发代理。","ja":"Unity Netcode を使用したマルチプレイヤーアプリケーション向けのゲーム開発エージェントに最適。","ko":"유니티 넷코드를 사용하는 멀티플레이어 애플리케이션에 필요한 전문 지식을 갖춘 게임 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo de Juegos que requieren experiencia en Unity Netcode para aplicaciones de juegos multijugador.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement de jeux nécessitant une expertise en Unity Netcode pour les applications de jeux multijoueurs.","de":"Ideal für Game-Entwicklungsagenten, die Expertenwissen in Unity Netcode für Multiplayer-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de Jogos que requerem especialização em Unity Netcode para aplicações multiplayer.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по разработке игр, требующих опыта работы с Unity Netcode для мультиплеерных приложений.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير الألعاب التي تتطلب خبرة في Unity Netcode لتطبيقات اللاعبين المتعددين."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to configure NetworkBehaviour and set up Distributed Authority topology for seamless network management, leveraging Unity''s Netcode library for efficient multiplayer interactions and utilizing protocols like NetworkManager for player prefab spawning and scene management.","zh":"赋予代理配置 NetworkBehaviour 和设置分布式授权拓扑结构的能力，实现无缝的网络管理，利用 Unity 的 Netcode 库实现高效的多人游戏交互，并使用 NetworkManager 等协议进行玩家预制体生成和场景管理。","ja":"エージェントに NetworkBehaviour を構成し、分散型の認可トポロジーを設定する能力を付与し、無縫のネットワーク管理を実現し、Unity の Netcode ライブラリを利用して効率的なマルチプレイヤーインタラクションを実現し、NetworkManager などのプロトコルを使用してプレイヤーのプレハブ生成やシーン管理を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 네트워크 동작과 분산형 권한 토폴로지를 설정할 수 있도록 해주어, 무중단 네트워크 관리를 가능하게 하며, 유니티의 넷코드 라이브러리를 사용하여 효율적인 멀티플레이어 상호 작용을 구현하고, 네트워크 매니저를 사용하여 플레이어 프리팹 생성 및 씬 관리를 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a configurar NetworkBehaviour y establecer una topología de Autoridad Distribuida para una administración de red sin problemas, aprovechando la biblioteca de Netcode de Unity para interacciones de multiplayer eficientes y utilizando protocolos como NetworkManager para la generación de prefabs de jugador y la administración de escenas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de configurer NetworkBehaviour et de mettre en place une topologie d''autorité distribuée pour une gestion de réseau sans problème, en exploitant la bibliothèque Netcode d''Unity pour des interactions de multiplayer efficaces et en utilisant des protocoles tels que NetworkManager pour la génération de prefabs de joueur et la gestion de scènes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, NetworkBehaviour zu konfigurieren und eine Distributed Authority-Topologie für eine nahtlose Netzwerkverwaltung einzurichten, wobei die Netcode-Bibliothek von Unity für effiziente Multiplayer-Interaktionen genutzt wird und Protokolle wie NetworkManager für die Erzeugung von Spieler-Prefabs und Szenenverwaltung verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a configurar NetworkBehaviour e definir a topologia de Autoridade Distribuída para gerenciamento de rede sem interrupções, aproveitando a biblioteca Netcode da Unity para interações de multiplayer eficientes e utilizando protocolos como NetworkManager para spawn de prefabs de jogador e gerenciamento de cena.","ru":"Позволяет агентам настраивать NetworkBehaviour и устанавливать топологию распределенной власти для бесперебойного управления сетью, используя библиотеку Netcode от Unity для эффективного взаимодействия в мультиплеерных режимах и используя протоколы типа NetworkManager для спавна игровых персонажей и управления сценами.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تكوين NetworkBehaviour وتحديد طوبولوجيا السلطة الموزعة لإدارة الشبكة دون انقطاع، واستخدام مكتبة Unity Netcode للتفاعلات المتعددة اللاعبين بكفاءة، واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل NetworkManager لإعادة إنشاء مسبقات اللاعب وتحديد المشاهد."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring Distributed Authority topology for Unity multiplayer games","Implementing NetworkBehaviour for network management and synchronization","Debugging network issues in Unity applications using Netcode patterns"],"zh":["为 Unity 多人游戏配置分布式授权拓扑结构","实现 NetworkBehaviour 进行网络管理和同步","使用 Netcode 模式调试 Unity 应用中的网络问题"],"ja":["Unity マルチプレイヤーゲーム向けの分散型認可トポロジー構成","NetworkBehaviour を使用したネットワーク管理と同期の実装","Netcode パターンを使用した Unity アプリケーションのネットワーク問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["유니티 멀티플레이어 게임을 위한 분산형 권한 토폴로지 구성","네트워크 동작을 위한 네트워크 동작 및同步 구현","넷코드 패턴을 사용한 유니티 애플리케이션의 네트워크 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Configuración de la topología de Autoridad Distribuida para juegos de Unity multijugador","Implementación de NetworkBehaviour para la administración y sincronización de la red","Depuración de problemas de red en aplicaciones de Unity utilizando patrones de Netcode"],"fr":["Configuration de la topologie d''autorité distribuée pour les jeux de Unity multijoueurs","Mise en œuvre de NetworkBehaviour pour la gestion et la synchronisation du réseau","Débogage des problèmes de réseau dans les applications Unity en utilisant des modèles de Netcode"],"de":["Konfiguration der Distributed Authority-Topologie für Unity-Multiplayer-Spiele","Implementierung von NetworkBehaviour für Netzwerkverwaltung und -synchronisation","Fehlerbehebung bei Netzwerkproblemen in Unity-Anwendungen unter Verwendung von Netcode-Mustern"],"pt":["Configurando a topologia de Autoridade Distribuída para jogos multiplayer da Unity","Implementando NetworkBehaviour para gerenciamento de rede e sincronização","Depurando problemas de rede em aplicações da Unity usando padrões Netcode"],"ru":["Настройка топологии распределенной власти для мультиплеерных игр Unity","Реализация NetworkBehaviour для управления сетью и синхронизации","Отладка сетевых проблем в приложениях Unity с помощью шаблонов Netcode"],"ar":["تكوين طوبولوجيا السلطة الموزعة لألعاب اللاعبين المتعددين في Unity","تطبيق NetworkBehaviour لإدارة الشبكة والتنسيق","تصحيح الأخطاء في مشاكل الشبكة في تطبيقات Unity باستخدام أنماط Netcode"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Unity game engine","Limited to C# programming language","Dependent on Unity''s Netcode library and NetworkManager"],"zh":["需要 Unity 游戏引擎","仅限 C# 编程语言","依赖于 Unity 的 Netcode 库和 NetworkManager"],"ja":["Unity ゲームエンジンが必要","C# プログラミング言語のみ","Unity の Netcode ライブラリと NetworkManager への依存"],"ko":["유니티 게임 엔진 필요","C# 프로그래밍 언어만 해당","유니티의 넷코드 라이브러리와 네트워크 매니저에 의존"],"es":["Requiere el motor de juego Unity","Limitado al lenguaje de programación C#","Dependiente de la biblioteca de Netcode de Unity y NetworkManager"],"fr":["Nécessite le moteur de jeu Unity","Limité au langage de programmation C#","Dépendant de la bibliothèque Netcode d''Unity et de NetworkManager"],"de":["Benötigt die Unity-Spiel-Engine","Begrenzt auf die C#-Programmiersprache","Abhängig von der Netcode-Bibliothek von Unity und NetworkManager"],"pt":["Requer o motor de jogo Unity","Limitado à linguagem de programação C#","Dependente da biblioteca Netcode da Unity e do NetworkManager"],"ru":["Требует игрового движка Unity","Ограничен языком программирования C#","Зависит от библиотеки Netcode от Unity и NetworkManager"],"ar":["يتطلب محرك الألعاب Unity","محدود بلغة البرمجة C#","يعتمد على مكتبة Unity Netcode و NetworkManager"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"40b076c36601809117feacded26abeea7bb37ca48449ef150db62f2ec110acaa","qualityScore":33}');
