tuning methods","dynoai-domain-expert install for Harley-Davidson motorcycles","what is dynoai-domain-expert and its benefits","dynoai-domain-expert alternative for V-twin engine tuning"],"zh":["dynoai-domain-expert","AI工具","V-twin发动机","确定性dyno调优","REST API","React前端","Python核心库","PyQt6","脚本/CLI"],"ja":["dynoai-domain-expert","AIエージェント","ハーレーダビッドソン","V-twinエンジン","決定性dynoチューニング","REST API","Reactフロントエンド","Pythonコアライブラリ","PyQt6","スクリプト/CLI"],"ko":["dynoai-domain-expert","AI 에이전트","하ーレ이戴비슨","V-twin 엔진","결정적 dyno 튜닝","REST API","React 프론트엔드","Python 코어 라이브러리","PyQt6","스크립트/CLI"],"es":["dynoai domain expert","ajuste de motores V-twin","inteligencia artificial para motores","desarrollo de software para motores","Flask para motores","React para motores","Python para motores","ajuste determinista de motores","herramientas de ajuste de motores"],"fr":["dynoai domain expert","réglage de moteurs V-twin","intelligence artificielle pour moteurs","développement de logiciels pour moteurs","Flask pour moteurs","React pour moteurs","Python pour moteurs","réglage déterministe de moteurs","outils de réglage de moteurs"],"de":["dynoai domain expert","einstellung von V-twin-Motoren","künstliche Intelligenz für Motoren","Softwareentwicklung für Motoren","Flask für Motoren","React für Motoren","Python für Motoren","deterministische Einstellung von Motoren","Werkzeuge für die Einstellung von Motoren"],"pt":["DynoAI Domain Expert","tuning de motores","React","Python","Flask","desenvolvimento de soluções","APIs REST","Vite","Tailwind","CLI"],"ru":["DynoAI Domain Expert","настройка двигателей","React","Python","Flask","разработка решений","REST API","Vite","Tailwind","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["DynoAI Domain Expert","ضبط المحركات","React","Python","Flask","تطوير الحلول","واجهات برمجة تطبيقات REST","Vite","Tailwind","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"rob9206","repo":"DynoAI_3","repoPath":"rob9206/DynoAI_3","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.590Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dynoai-domain-expert","description":"Provides domain knowledge for the DynoAI dyno-tuning platform including VE math, JetDrive hardware protocols, ECU calibration concepts, and architecture ownership. Use when editing any DynoAI source file, discussing tuning logic, or when the user mentions VE tables, AFR, JetDrive, ECU calibration, cylinder balance, or zone classification.","bodyPreview":"# DynoAI Domain Expert\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\nDynoAI is a monorepo for deterministic dyno tuning of Harley-Davidson motorcycles (V-twin engines). It consists of:\n\n| Layer | Stack | Root |\n|-------|-------|------|\n| REST API | Flask 3.0, SQLAlchemy, Flasgger | `api/` |\n| Frontend | React 19, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind, Radix/shadcn | `frontend/` |\n| Core Library | Python, NumPy, Pandas | `dynoai/` |\n| Desktop GUI | PyQt6 | `gui/` |\n| Scripts/CLI | Python, PowerShell, Batch | `scripts/` |\n\nVer","body":"# DynoAI Domain Expert\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\nDynoAI is a monorepo for deterministic dyno tuning of Harley-Davidson motorcycles (V-twin engines). It consists of:\n\n| Layer | Stack | Root |\n|-------|-------|------|\n| REST API | Flask 3.0, SQLAlchemy, Flasgger | `api/` |\n| Frontend | React 19, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind, Radix/shadcn | `frontend/` |\n| Core Library | Python, NumPy, Pandas | `dynoai/` |\n| Desktop GUI | PyQt6 | `gui/` |\n| Scripts/CLI | Python, PowerShell, Batch | `scripts/` |\n\nVersion single source: `dynoai/version.py`\n\n## Key File Ownership Map\n\n| Responsibility | Owner Files |\n|---|---|\n| VE correction math | `dynoai/core/ve_math.py` |\n| Auto-tune pipeline | `api/services/autotune_workflow.py` |\n| VE apply workflow (frontend) | `frontend/src/utils/veApply/veApplyCore.ts` |\n| Zone classification | `frontend/src/utils/veApply/zoneClassification.ts` |\n| Cylinder balance | `frontend/src/utils/veApply/cylinderBalance.ts` |\n| Confidence/clamp | `frontend/src/utils/veApply/confidenceCalculator.ts` |\n| Coverage metrics | `frontend/src/utils/veApply/coverageCalculator.ts` |\n| VE bounds enforcement | `frontend/src/utils/veApply/veBounds.ts` |\n| Safety validation | `frontend/src/utils/veApply/veApplyValidation.ts` |\n| Flask app + blueprint registration | `api/app.py` |\n| Custom exceptions | `api/errors.py` |\n| Centralized config | `api/config.py` |\n| Auth (API key) | `api/auth.py` |\n| Rate limiting | `api/rate_limit.py` |\n| Shared TS types | `frontend/src/types/veApplyTypes.ts`, `frontend/src/lib/types.ts` |\n| Axios client | `frontend/src/lib/api.ts` |\n| Route definitions | `frontend/src/App.tsx` |\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### VE (Volumetric Efficiency) Tables\n\nA 2D grid indexed by RPM (rows) and MAP/kPa (columns). Each cell holds a VE percentage representing how much of the theoretical cylinder volume actually fills with air. The ECU uses VE to calculate fuel injection pulse width.\n\n**Correction math (v2.0.0, default):**\n```\nVE_correction = AFR_measured / AFR_target\n```\nA correction of 1.077 means +7.7% more fuel needed. Legacy v1.0.0 used `1 + (AFR_error * 0.07)`.\n\n**AFR targets vary by MAP:**\n```\n20-30 kPa: 14.7 (stoich)    70 kPa: 13.0\n40 kPa: 14.5                80 kPa: 12.8\n50 kPa: 14.0                90 kPa: 12.5\n60 kPa: 13.5               100 kPa: 12.2\n```\n\n### Zones\n\nEvery VE cell belongs to a zone based on its RPM and MAP coordinates:\n\n| Zone | MAP (kPa) | RPM | Weight | Typical riding |\n|------|-----------|-----|--------|----------------|\n| cruise | 31-69 | 1200-5500 | 5 | ~70% of miles |\n| partThrottle | 70-94 | 1200-5500 | 4 | Roll-on accel |\n| wot | 95+ | 1200-5500 | 2 | Full power pulls |\n| decel | <=30 | 1200-5500 | 1 | Engine braking |\n| edge | any | <1200 or >5500 | 1 | Idle/redline |\n\nZone determines confidence thresholds and coverage weighting.\n\n### Confidence and Clamping\n\nHit count (number of data samples in a cell) determines confidence:\n\n| Confidence | Clamp limit | Meaning |\n|---|---|---|\n| high | +/-7% | Trustworthy data |\n| medium | +/-5% | Some uncertainty |\n| low | +/-3% | Uncertain, conservative |\n| skip | null | Below minHits, preserve base VE |\n\nEach zone has its own `minHits`, `mediumHits`, `highHits` thresholds (e.g., cruise needs 100 hits for high confidence).\n\n### Cylinder Balance (V-Twin Specific)\n\nFront and rear cylinders are analyzed separately. Key metrics:\n- **Systematic bias**: weighted average of `(rear/front - 1) * 100`. Positive = rear needs more fuel.\n- **Localized imbalance**: max absolute difference across cells.\n- Warnings at >2% systematic bias or >5% localized imbalance.\n- Both cylinders must have >= 3 hits per cell for inclusion.\n\n### VE Bounds Presets\n\n| Preset | Range | Enforcement | Use case |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| na_harley | 15-115% | enforce | Stock/mild cams |\n| stage_1 | 15-120% | enforce | Stage 1 cams |\n| stage_2 | 15-125% | enforce | Stage 2+ cams |\n| boosted | 10-200% | warn only | Turbo/supercharged |\n| custom | 0-999% | warn only | No enforcement |\n\n### Coverage\n\nZone-weighted metric: `sum(sufficientCells * weight) / sum(totalCells * weight)`. Grades: A (>=90%), B (>=75%), C (>=60%), D (>=40%), F (<40%). Warns if cruise zone < 60%.\n\n## Safety Constraints (CRITICAL)\n\n1. **Deterministic math only** -- no ML/AI in the VE correction path. Corrections use pure arithmetic.\n2. **Bounded adjustments** -- default max correction +/-15% per session. Extreme corrections (>+/-25%) block the apply entirely.\n3. **Dual-cylinder requirement** -- both front and rear data required; partial data blocks apply.\n4. **VE bounds enforcement** -- physical limits prevent impossible VE values.\n5. **Zero-hit cells untouched** -- cells with no data always get correction = 1.0 (no change).\n6. **Convergence over perfection** -- large errors are corrected incrementally across multiple sessions rather than in one step.\n\n## JetDrive Hardware Integration\n\nJetDrive is Dynojet''s real-time data acquisition hardware for dynos.\n\n**Discovery protocol:**\n- UDP multicast on port `22344`\n- Primary group: `224.0.2.10`\n- Alternatives: `239.255.60.60`, `224.0.0.1`, `239.192.0.1`\n- Packets: up to 4096 bytes UDP datagrams\n\n**Auto-tune pipeline:**\n1. Import log (Power Vision CSV, JetDrive CSV, or DataFrame)\n2. Filter signals (lowpass RC=500ms, outlier rejection at 2 sigma)\n3. Bin data into RPM x MAP grid (11 RPM x 9 MAP = 99 cells)\n4. Calculate AFR error per cell vs targets\n5. Convert to VE corrections with clamping\n6. Export: PVV XML, TuneLab script, CSV grids, manifest.json\n\n## Error Handling Patterns\n\nAll Flask routes use `api/errors.py`:\n- `@with_error_handling` decorator catches exceptions\n- Custom classes: `ValidationError` (400), `NotFoundError` (404), `AnalysisError` (500), `JetDriveError` (502), etc.\n- Standardized JSON responses with request ID tracking\n\n## Additional Resources\n\nFor architecture details and file ownership, see [architecture-map.md](architecture-map.md).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:12:01.242Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Automotive Analysis Agents needing advanced dyno tuning capabilities for Harley-Davidson motorcycles","zh":"适用于需要高级动力计调试功能的汽车分析代理，特别是哈雷戴维森摩托车","ja":"ハーレーダビッドソン・モーターサイクル向けの高度なダイノチューニング機能を必要とする自動車分析エージェントに最適","ko":"고급 동력계 조정 기능이 필요한 자동차 분석 에이전트에게 적합하며, 특히 하ーレ이戴비슨 모터사이클","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis Automotriz que necesitan capacidades de afinación de dinamómetro avanzadas para motocicletas Harley-Davidson","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse Automobile ayant besoin de capacités de réglage de dyno avancées pour les motocyclettes Harley-Davidson","de":"Perfekt für Automotive-Analyse-Agenten, die erweiterte Dyno-Stimmfähigkeiten für Harley-Davidson-Motorräder benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Automotiva que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de afinação de dinamômetro para motocicletas Harley-Davidson","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа автомобилей, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности настройки динамометра для мотоциклов Harley-Davidson","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التحليلية السيارات التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لتعديل دينامو لدراجات هارلي ديفيدسون"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform deterministic dyno tuning using REST API, Flask 3.0, and SQLAlchemy, while leveraging frontend technologies like React 19 and TypeScript for comprehensive analysis and visualization of V-twin engine performance","zh":"赋予代理执行确定性动力计调试的能力，使用REST API、Flask 3.0和SQLAlchemy，同时利用React 19和TypeScript等前端技术进行综合分析和可视化V型发动机性能","ja":"REST API、Flask 3.0、SQLAlchemyを使用して決定論的なダイノチューニングを実行するエージェントを可能にし、React 19やTypeScriptなどのフロントエンド技術を利用してV型エンジンの性能を包括的に分析および視覚化する","ko":"REST API, Flask 3.0, SQLAlchemy를 사용하여 결정적 동력계 조정을 수행할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, React 19 및 TypeScript와 같은 프론트엔드 기술을 활용하여 V형 엔진 성능을 종합적으로 분석하고 시각화하는 것","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar un afinado de dinamómetro determinista utilizando REST API, Flask 3.0 y SQLAlchemy, al mismo tiempo que aprovecha tecnologías frontend como React 19 y TypeScript para un análisis y visualización exhaustivos del rendimiento del motor V-twin","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer un réglage de dyno déterministe en utilisant REST API, Flask 3.0 et SQLAlchemy, tout en exploitant les technologies frontend comme React 19 et TypeScript pour une analyse et une visualisation complètes des performances du moteur V-twin","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, eine deterministische Dyno-Stimmung durchzuführen, indem sie REST API, Flask 3.0 und SQLAlchemy verwenden, während sie gleichzeitig Frontend-Technologien wie React 19 und TypeScript für eine umfassende Analyse und Visualisierung der Leistung des V-twin-Motors nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar afinação de dinamômetro determinística usando REST API, Flask 3.0 e SQLAlchemy, aproveitando tecnologias de frontend como React 19 e TypeScript para análise e visualização abrangentes do desempenho do motor V-twin","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять детерминированную настройку динамометра с помощью REST API, Flask 3.0 и SQLAlchemy, используя технологии frontend, такие как React 19 и TypeScript, для всестороннего анализа и визуализации производительности двигателя V-twin","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من أداء تعديل دينامو محدد باستخدام REST API و Flask 3.0 و SQLAlchemy، و الاستفادة من تقنيات الواجهة الأمامية مثل React 19 و TypeScript من أجل تحليل وتصوير شامل لأداء محرك V-twin"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating dyno tuning for Harley-Davidson motorcycles","Generating performance reports using NumPy and Pandas","Debugging issues with desktop GUI applications built with PyQt6"],"zh":["为哈雷戴维森摩托车自动化动力计调试","使用NumPy和Pandas生成性能报告","使用PyQt6构建的桌面GUI应用程序进行调试"],"ja":["ハーレーダビッドソン・モーターサイクル向けのダイノチューニングの自動化","NumPyとPandasを使用して性能レポートを生成する","PyQt6で構築されたデスクトップGUIアプリケーションのデバッグ"],"ko":["하ーレ이戴비슨 모터사이클을 위한 동력계 조정 자동화","NumPy와 Pandas를 사용하여 성능 보고서를 생성","PyQt6로 구축된 데스크톱 GUI 응용 프로그램을 위한 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar el afinado de dinamómetro para motocicletas Harley-Davidson","Generar informes de rendimiento utilizando NumPy y Pandas","Depurar problemas con aplicaciones de GUI de escritorio construidas con PyQt6"],"fr":["Automatiser le réglage de dyno pour les motocyclettes Harley-Davidson","Générer des rapports de performances en utilisant NumPy et Pandas","Déboguer les problèmes avec des applications de GUI de bureau construites avec PyQt6"],"de":["Automatisieren der Dyno-Stimmung für Harley-Davidson-Motorräder","Erstellen von Leistungsberichten unter Verwendung von NumPy und Pandas","Beheben von Problemen mit Desktop-GUI-Anwendungen, die mit PyQt6 erstellt wurden"],"pt":["Automatizar a afinação de dinamômetro para motocicletas Harley-Davidson","Gerar relatórios de desempenho usando NumPy e Pandas","Depurar problemas com aplicações de interface gráfica de usuário de área de trabalho construídas com PyQt6"],"ru":["Автоматизировать настройку динамометра для мотоциклов Harley-Davidson","Генерировать отчеты о производительности с помощью NumPy и Pandas","Отлаживать проблемы с приложениями графического интерфейса пользователя рабочего стола, построенными с помощью PyQt6"],"ar":["تأتمتة تعديل دينامو لدراجات هارلي ديفيدسون","توليد تقارير الأداء باستخدام NumPy و Pandas","تصحيح مشاكل في تطبيقات واجهة المستخدم الرسومية لمكتب باستخدام PyQt6"]},"limitations":{"en":["Specific to Harley-Davidson motorcycles with V-twin engines","Requires Python and compatible libraries like Flask and NumPy","Monorepo architecture may require additional setup and configuration"],"zh":["仅适用于V型发动机的哈雷戴维森摩托车","需要Python和兼容库如Flask和NumPy","单体仓库架构可能需要额外的设置和配置"],"ja":["V型エンジンのハーレーダビッドソン・モーターサイクルにのみ対応","PythonとFlaskやNumPyなどの互換ライブラリが必要","モノレポ・アーキテクチャでは追加の設定と構成が必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["V형 엔진의 하ーレ이戴비슨 모터사이클만 해당","Python 및 Flask, NumPy와 같은 호환 라이브러리가 필요","모노레포 아키텍처에서는 추가적인 설정 및 구성이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Específico para motocicletas Harley-Davidson con motores V-twin","Requiere Python y bibliotecas compatibles como Flask y NumPy","La arquitectura monorepo puede requerir una configuración y configuración adicionales"],"fr":["Spécifique aux motocyclettes Harley-Davidson avec des moteurs V-twin","Nécessite Python et des bibliothèques compatibles comme Flask et NumPy","L''architecture monorepo peut nécessiter une configuration et une installation supplémentaires"],"de":["Spezifisch für Harley-Davidson-Motorräder mit V-twin-Motoren","Benötigt Python und kompatible Bibliotheken wie Flask und NumPy","Die Monorepo-Architektur kann eine zusätzliche Einrichtung und Konfiguration erfordern"],"pt":["Específico para motocicletas Harley-Davidson com motores V-twin","Exige Python e bibliotecas compatíveis como Flask e NumPy","A arquitetura de monorepo pode exigir configuração e instalação adicionais"],"ru":["Конкретно для мотоциклов Harley-Davidson с двигателями V-twin","Требует Python и совместимых библиотек, таких как Flask и NumPy","Архитектура monorepo может потребовать дополнительной настройки и конфигурации"],"ar":["محدد لدراجات هارلي ديفيدسون بمحركات V-twin","يتطلب Python ومكتبات متوافقة مثل Flask و NumPy","